Package: fastsas
Title: Fast SAS7BDAT Reader Backed by Rust
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Tobias", "Kragholm", , "tkragholm@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: High-performance reader for SAS7BDAT files. The parsing core is
    implemented in Rust (the 'sas7bdat' crate) and exposed to R via 'extendr'.
    Returns a 'tibble' with column types compatible with 'haven': Date,
    POSIXct, hms, character and double.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/tkragholm/sas7bdat-parser-rs
BugReports: https://github.com/tkragholm/sas7bdat-parser-rs/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Copyright: See inst/AUTHORS for the copyright holders of the Rust
    crates bundled in src/rust/vendor.tar.xz.
Language: en-US
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
